                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "017e6fdb-6dfe-3ffa-8ece-38a244d38a1a",
                        "entry_id": "04e8a1f8-4c88-3b43-8b12-0c9ef7b2e8d4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. страд. прич. наст. вр. от смотреть"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "participle"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6fb7336-ff05-4698-8ad3-739a42e29226",
                                "sense_id": "017e6fdb-6dfe-3ffa-8ece-38a244d38a1a",
                                "text": "Не представляю я, чем еще можно заниматься в четыре часа то ли ночи то ли утра, когда уже […] все передачи единственного смотримого мной канала National Geographic выучены наизусть […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3dcadf2-49ee-3729-9504-fc80fa576b82",
                        "entry_id": "04e8a1f8-4c88-3b43-8b12-0c9ef7b2e8d4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "адъектив., разг. такой, который многие смотрят, посмотрели, просматриваемый, являющийся популярным в телеэфире"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2298cbad-2695-451e-aca6-9394839e2751",
                                "sense_id": "c3dcadf2-49ee-3729-9504-fc80fa576b82",
                                "text": "Однако стараниями именно продюсеров церемония вручения «Глобуса» стала одной из самых смотримых телепрограмм в мире."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5835df37-bd3d-43f5-a097-ad10e9456be6",
                                "sense_id": "c3dcadf2-49ee-3729-9504-fc80fa576b82",
                                "text": "Напомним, что канал FOX возродил еще несколько своих хитовых сериалов, но лишь новым «Секретным материалам» удалось попасть в число самых смотримых сериалов сезона 2015–2016 годов."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c635f343-ab9b-3927-b53c-0026d847ec9d",
                        "entry_id": "04e8a1f8-4c88-3b43-8b12-0c9ef7b2e8d4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "адъектив., разг. характеризующийся большим количеством зрителей перед экранами телевизора (о времени)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3495a6bd-d276-4b4a-becc-4d2a17c80a2b",
                                "sense_id": "c635f343-ab9b-3927-b53c-0026d847ec9d",
                                "text": "Почему на «НТВ» фильму выделили самое смотримое время — 19.50, а нам опять 22.30? Мои знакомые, родственники, сотрудники в такое позднее время телевизор уже не смотрят."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7492a530-3eff-42fa-bebc-ad25f17fde4a",
                        "source_entry_id": "04e8a1f8-4c88-3b43-8b12-0c9ef7b2e8d4",
                        "source_sense_description": "прич. страд. от смотреть",
                        "target_lang_word": "watched",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "watched",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bb1e9d4-f311-313f-a288-824ca1b500d0",
                                        "entry_id": "d5178d6c-4608-3d9d-9c98-c887dcacf622",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "simple past and past participle of watch"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "participle",
                                            "past"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "watched",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cafca9-79f1-3baa-8e99-7f5dbd89e208",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wearing a watch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e08f9bd-1f18-4792-9bd3-f39ddb9da268",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "Passing the third checkpoint, the third smiling [sic] state policeman, a fellow by the name of R. C. Anderson, raises his big silver-watched wrist and touches the brim of his gray felt Stetson (yes, he does) as one faintly remembers Wendell Corey once doing from high on a Canadian Mountie snow peak overlooking something like a distressed Linda Darnell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3418e28-82ce-4680-a3ef-d56a69a88fc6",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "Conrad Scott then grabbed Senator Moss’s watched wrist and thrust it into the air, allowing the crowd to exercise their delirium one last time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45a3c38e-8171-4039-945c-531f5689d932",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "Kara grimaced at the last but waved it away with flick of her Swatch watched wrist saying, “Angie you’re exaggerating. It can’t have been that bad. You seemed happy. You had your share.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8634460-45fa-43a8-a8ab-cf5e9367af1a",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "Edward surfaced from his performance to see a man who appeared composed of only sharp angles standing in the foyer, where the light caught his gold-watched wrist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3652d77-17b7-46f4-8b4f-beac364fc8f3",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "So too the human shield protecting the pathway beyond the gates, a young man in a security uniform who cheerfully declared upon espying me, ‘Only nine seconds exactly to go until we open!’ while waving his watched wrist in the air."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45b8f52d-478d-4040-8c6b-683fcf427c02",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "He wasn’t looking up but was instead staring straight ahead at the school principal, his legs crossed, a Rolex-watched wrist draped languidly over one knee in an almost feminine pose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "950f9161-c685-4893-a785-fa78a32a95f6",
                                                "sense_id": "ab862a1b-bd50-3fb2-a7d1-6218a287a8a6",
                                                "text": "The hairy, gold-watched wrist of an airline captain changing gear in a sports car while enjoying a Rothmans cigarette stood for all he could never be, even as it opened out a little hollow of confused desire within him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ae009ce-c401-3332-913e-02b8fc738e7f",
                                        "entry_id": "d2cafca9-79f1-3baa-8e99-7f5dbd89e208",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Monitored."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2fd46df-7b99-4e3c-b3eb-15d92fdee534",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae009ce-c401-3332-913e-02b8fc738e7f",
                                                "text": "You would certainly think the watched quantum pot would also boil. It turns out, because of the vigilant observations, the transition never occurs; the watched quantum pot never boils."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f36aabb-c9d0-40bd-a50c-3d96d188a330",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae009ce-c401-3332-913e-02b8fc738e7f",
                                                "text": "The upper bound only needs to be updated when one of the watched M variables is assigned to false."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af776509-dc2b-462e-9cf1-b7a2ff3bafd0",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae009ce-c401-3332-913e-02b8fc738e7f",
                                                "text": "To mimic the effect, students are asked to undertake an activity, with you, the instructor, monitoring ony half the class. Afterwards, you compare the work produced by the \"watched\" students with the work produced by the \"unwatched.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2052daf-ff32-4655-a35a-395f4c299868",
